ind":"announcement","title":"Evergreen Clicker Demo Is Live on Steam! 🌱","summary":"Evergreen Clicker Demo is now LIVE on Steam! 🌱You can finally jump in and try the game for yourself.In the demo, you can:Grow your tree from a tiny sprout into something much biggerEarn and spend Seeds on upgradesUnlock and experiment with the Talent TreeTry the new Combo SystemDiscover events and other progression systemsGet a feel for the relaxing but active clicker gameplayEvergreen Clicker is still in development, so the demo will continue to improve as we polish the game, add features, and ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-08T14:40:49Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314347563","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:42:55Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4750910-1840310314341913","game_id":"steam-4750910","kind":"announcement","title":"I Added a Combo System to My Clicker Game","summary":"Here’s a first look at the new Combo System in Evergreen Clicker! Keep clicking with the correct timing to build your combo, earn Good and Excellent ratings, and increase your click bonus. The longer you maintain the rhythm, the more powerful each click becomes—but miss the timing and the combo resets! This is still a work in progress, so the visuals, balancing, and effects may continue to improve. Wishlist Evergreen Clicker on Steam and follow the development! #EvergreenClicker #IndieGame #Clic","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-06T13:24:27Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314341913","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:42:55Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4750910-1839041357038563","game_id":"steam-4750910","kind":"announcement","title":"How Evergreen Clicker Started","summary":"How it startedEvergreen Clicker started with one very rough drawing made in the middle of the night.I couldn’t sleep, so I sketched a simple idea: a tree in the centre, upgrades on the side, and a number that keeps growing when you click.It looked ugly. Very ugly. 😂But the basic idea stuck with me.I wanted to make an incremental game that felt peaceful instead of stressful. No armies, no endless killing, no dark apocalypse. Just planting trees, growing forests, unlocking new systems, and eventua","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-28T15:06:28Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839041357038563","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:42:55Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4750910":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T04:02:26Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T04:02:26Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4750910":"2026-10-26T04:02:26Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4750910":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T04:02:26Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T04:02:26Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"5031510":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T04:02:26Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T04:02:26Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4750910","app_id":4750910,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:55Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"81bea81901a65ac59e89be24f0ea089206951d9fe0fec3ac9aaa9a79a6e2cb6f","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"Grow a thriving forest in this cozy incremental clicker. Plant trees, unlock upgrades, weather the changing seasons, trigger Forest Renewal, and build an ever-stronger woodland th